## Status Legend
- `Queued — New Lead` — Verified active role (`Tier A` or `Tier B1`) awaiting Workflow 1 resume tailoring and application prep.
- `Drafted — Pending HITL Review` — Tailored 1-page PDF and cold email dossier (or Gmail draft) prepared; awaiting user approval.
- `Ready for HITL Browser Apply` — Tailored 1-page PDF and verified ATS form map staged for pre-submit browser fill and user Submit click.
- `Paused — Human Gate` — Paused cleanly on an unconditional stop (CAPTCHA/hCaptcha, email verification code, login/MFA, `[HUMAN AUTHORING REQUIRED]` anti-LLM check, or shady legal clause).
- `Submitted (HITL Confirmed)` — Application submitted by user or cold email sent after explicit user approval.
- `Submitted (YOLO Guardrailed)` — Website application auto-submitted under explicit opt-in `yolo_with_guardrails` after passing all truth/trap/safety gates.
- `Follow-up Sent` — Day 5–7 outreach follow-up sent after explicit user approval.
- `Interviewing` / `Closed` — Active interview stage or archived outcome.
- `Skipped — Role Mismatch` — Excluded on eligibility or track mismatch during pre-apply screening.

